<p><a name="fn10"></a>10. See the May 2023 Federal Open Market Committee Statement, which is available on the Board's website at <a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/fomccalendars.htm">https://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/fomccalendars.htm</a>. <a href="#f10">Return to text</a></p>

